# Service level summary

For priority-1 incidents the response time is two (2) hours from the time the ticket is opened [[cite:obs-be77c1386c4c00b804fc759c55a5111b7d320056 "For priority-1 incidents the response time is two (2) hours from the time the ticket is opened."]]. Priority-1 incidents are escalated to the on-call engineer through the pager rotation [[cite:obs-ad705ebbb11d6e6cca54cacc33639826202afe0f "Priority-1 incidents are escalated to the on-call engineer through the pager rotation."]].